WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.930
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:44.040
It's not going to be like before.

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:49.000
Because today I'm starting my
first year of junior high!

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:55.970
My bangs are too long,
I should just cut them.

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:02.310
From today on...
I'll remember everything...

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:04.430
all the new things...

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:07.560
and all the new experiences.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:10.520
Experiences must surely be a lot.

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:19.820
Look, in the mirror,
there's a new me.

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:24.120
Good... good...
this was cut very well...

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:25.830
Good morning, Shimura-san!

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:28.500
Good morning, Sana-chan. Late today?

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:32.790
It isn't late, Shimura-san,
I woke up early so that I can take things slowly.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:35.130
But isn't this a dream?

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:36.130
What?!

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:43.430
It was a dream?!

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:46.430
I'm gonna be late again!

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:47.770
You're gonna be
like how you used to be.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:52.610
I Met My Best Friend
in the Bathroom

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:00.910
Sana-chan! What are you doing,
why are you so slow?!

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:03.490
Do you want to be late
on the first day of school?!

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:07.120
Rei-kun, you idiot!

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:10.460
Your voice is so loud that you
caused me to cut my bangs too short!

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:11.460
Look!

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:15.210
Don't worry! Don't worry!

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.420
You're only an anime
character, no one can tell the difference.

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:20.800
How can you act like this in front
of the TV viewers and say such harsh words!

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.840
My daughter, who's in
middle school, on her first day

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:25.220
is yelling because she
cut her bangs too short.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.770
She only cares about her hairstyle but doesn't realize

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:30.810
that her skirt's unzipped and showing her underwear...

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:32.980
but then... she's still a child.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:36.860
Sensei, you're still
writing the story about Sana-chan?

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:40.110
That's right, "My Daughter and I
Part II" will be an improvement!

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:44.320
I hope this will be a very
interesting book that reveals nothing

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.580
Who knows?

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:47.700
Lady, you're gonna be late
on the first day of school.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:48.580
Ah! That's right!

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:51.250
Ah! Sana-chan! Let's take a picture
of you in your school uniform.

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:52.710
Do a pose!

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:55.920
This time let's do a full body shot.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.670
No, or you'll take my feet
when I'm running.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:00.340
Ok, then I'll just take a picture
of your upper half.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:03.550
The inside
remains the same

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:03.550
Wearing her school uniform,
she's still...

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:08.220
Sana-chan is really going to
Junior High. Time passes by so fast.

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:11.520
Always like that... She forgot to
bring her book bag.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:12.560
This is it...

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:16.230
Sana-chan! You left
this! You left this!

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:21.110
Reading floating tea leaves? A form of fortune telling.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.240
How... gross.

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:26.620
This situation will
have good and bad points.

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:27.740
Is that so?

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:30.120
If she comes home safely,
it'll be too good to be true.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:31.750
Sensei, your expression looks scary

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:34.960
Jinbo School

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:34.960
Fresh out of the oven middle school students.

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.800
I'm Kurata Sana, 12 years old,
I'm an actress.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.880
Today, I'm gonna become a
Jinbo middle school first year student.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:48.640
I'm attending an escalator school
where most kids come from its own...

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:50.970
So the student
makeup is about the same.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:54.600
But about a third of the students
will be coming from other schools.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:58.690
Because of this, I think I can
make a lot of new friends.

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:03.030
You wish with your whole heart
that you can make new friends!

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:06.570
Morning, how are you,
do you know who I am?

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:08.660
Shinohara Tomoe-chan!

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:11.790
Your answer is correct!
Congratulations!

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:15.210
How great, it scared me,
just like a dream!

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:17.120
I think anyone would
have answered correctly.

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:21.380
Today we came to do a surprise
interview with you!

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:26.050
Today's your first day of
middle school, it's not good to do a interview.

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:29.930
But the TV station asked me to come,
and the producers told 'me' to come.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:32.850
That's why I'm here.
Do you get it?

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:34.270
I can say it again!

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:36.310
- One day I was walking and...
- I understood.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:38.770
And so I'm here!

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:43.400
But I really don't know
what to ask, please tell me.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:46.450
Shinohara, let's sing!

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:49.200
Oh so big! Scary!

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:52.950
Song, Sana-chan and
Shinohara Tomoe-chan

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:51.870
Concert!

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:52.990
A song...

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:56.410
Today, I became
a middle school student... Yes, yes...

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:59.420
Tomorrow I'll still be a first year
middle school student... That's right...

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:01.790
The school's big brothers and sisters...
Big brothers...

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:04.590
I feel a little scared...
A little scared...

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:07.800
I don't know how middle school life
will be... How will it be?

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:09.510
It makes people so nervous...

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:12.560
- Sana-chan's singing...
- She still likes to sing so much.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:14.270
The two of you are dancing as well.

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:16.850
Isn't that Sana-chan?
She's singing over there!

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:19.060
Sana-chan's in our school!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.270
How fun, Tomoe-chan!

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:25.320
It's over, thank you,
I have to kid farewell.

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:28.490
Wonderful! Great!
This is too much fun!

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:31.200
This week's guest... who's this?

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:33.030
It's Shinohara!

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:35.660
Good morning, Sana-chan!

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.330
You're showing your talents already?

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:38.960
Oh! Tsuyoshi-kun, Aya-chan!

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:42.920
Now that we're in middle school,
will you two be even closer to each other?

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:45.590
Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:49.180
Uh... Sana-chan...
You cut your bangs?

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:50.800
Aya-chan! Save me!

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:51.340
I think I cut it too short.

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.550
Let me see...

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:55.470
Why are you in this school?!

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:57.520
Really.

00:06:58.560 --> 00:06:59.730
Ugly.

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:03.400
- Ugly? Who are you calling ugly!
- I got my hair cut too.

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.110
Really? I don't see it.

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:07.230
This morning I went to the hair
salon and cut a whole 5 mm.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:10.240
You can't even decide
how to cut your own hair!

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:13.070
There's no way you can understand how I feel.

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:15.660
- Who's that?
- Eh? Gomi-kun?

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:17.290
Gomi-kun?

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:20.120
- You cut it like a monk.
- That's true.

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:20.670
Aya-chan, don't forget about me...

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.540
What happened?

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.670
My old man made me do it.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.590
Gomi-kun, what's wrong?

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:27.380
What's wrong, Gomi-sama?

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.630
I don't wanna explain it again.

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:31.720
But it's really amusing...

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:35.260
To watch everyone from the side
wearing junior high school uniforms...

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:37.100
this really brings back memories.

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:40.770
Tsuyoshi-kun, you're a big brother.
Stand up already.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:43.520
Hey, that's Kurata Sana-chan,
isn't it?

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:46.690
She and Shinohara Tomoe-chan sang together.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:51.240
These who are noticing Sana-chan,
they must come from our elementary school.

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:55.200
Suspicious person...
Let's put his photo on file.

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:57.030
Hey, what class are you in?

00:07:57.030 --> 00:07:57.990
Class 1.

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:00.620
Aw, I'm in class 8,
really far from you.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:03.790
- I'm in class 1, together with Aya-chan!
- We won't be separated!

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:06.210
I'm in class 7,
I'm in Class 8 with Sana-chan.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:08.340
They're all not clear
whose class everyone is in.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:11.760
Since we'll be splitting up,
let's take a group photo.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.430
I brought my camera too.

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:16.470
- Me too!
- Me too!

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.430
Oh, I don't know who's
taking pictures of who.

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:21.890
Hayama Akito.

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:25.270
Although I've kissed him twice,
we're enemies now.

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:28.320
Aya-chan, Tsuyoshi-kun,
A romantic couple.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:33.400
Hisae-chan is my old good friend,
Mami-chan is now my good friend too.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:38.580
And the gang from sixth grade class 3.
What changes will happen to them?

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:42.000
This is the suspicious kid
Babbit took a picture of.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:44.750
You guys go ahead.

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.580
- Oh really?
- Yeah... that's right.

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:48.880
Don't ask a young lady 'oh really? '

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:51.460
But you're this kind of young lady
who always says 'oh really? '

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:55.300
The bathroom should say
'Powder Room'.

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:55.300
This is a graceful young lady.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:59.640
I knew I cut it too short,
it doesn't suit me.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:03.600
Ahh... how terrible.
I cut my bangs too short.

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:07.690
Someone's like me. How great!
I have someone that can relate to me!

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:11.030
Can I use some of that mousse?

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:13.070
- Sure!
- Thank you.

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:14.530
Western accent...

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:18.870
I'm the same

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:19.160
Pardon me, this is my spot.

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:21.790
I cut my bangs too short this morning.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:24.870
Really? Me too.

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:27.460
Are you Sana-chan?

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:29.090
Yes! Sana here!

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:30.750
You don't have to be so surprised.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:33.960
I thought you looked a lot like her,
but I didn't think you were really her.

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:35.630
I didn't
think it was really you!

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:39.220
I heard people walking around Tokyo
would see celebrities, it's really true!

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:43.100
It can't be true.
where did you hear this?

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:44.100
Didn't you know?

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:47.100
If you walk around Tokyo
you'll see celebrities.

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:48.770
So you've been spreading rumors!

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:52.070
This is also the first time I heard
of it. My name is Matsui Fuka.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:53.320
Nice to meet you.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.690
Can I take a picture?

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.400
This is Fuka, another new friend.

00:09:57.400 --> 00:09:59.950
My name is Kurata Sana, did you know?

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:04.620
When I'm at hometown,
people say I look a lot like you.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:08.000
Ahh... since you mentioned it,
you really do look a little bit like me.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:11.460
Not only faces and bodies look
alike, all my old classmates of Osaka said that.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:13.590
...my personality is a lot
like yours.

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:15.550
Now that would be interesting!

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:17.130
If one of us doesn't come to school,
then the other can replace them.

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:18.470
Maybe we can even trick the teacher!

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:20.180
Ehh... that's great!
Next time we can try!

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:21.350
Yeah!

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:23.760
It's right there! Right there.

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:28.480
Her personality is like mine.
I look forward to our friendship in the future.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:33.320
Interesting?

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:31.520
The bad omen from my tea leaves
make some people look forward to it too.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.320
This is my spot!

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:39.860
To all the new students,
welcome to Jinbo Middle School!

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.320
Ah, looks like Principal Narunaru!

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:48.330
Those graduated from Jinbo
Elementary School must be fairly surprised.

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:52.290
I'm the big brother of the
Jinbo Elementary School Principal, Ari.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:57.130
Excuse me, please find the differences between the two. I'll give you 15 seconds.

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:02.600
The school's policies are honesty,
love and courage.

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:06.350
I don't want to force you to do it,
but do it naturally.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:10.020
- I'm finished.
- Wait, principal! That was so short!

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:14.440
- The brothers are so much alike.
- It's so much fun.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:16.150
The hair is different.

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:22.320
Um... Kurata-san, we'd be really
glad if you gave us an autograph.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:23.820
Um... ok.

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:28.830
Everyone's classmates, Sana-chan
doesn't want you to treat her differently.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:30.580
This her private time.

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:34.710
Yeah... I do wish I could be
treated just like a normal person.

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:36.840
Anyway, two autographs
won't make a difference!

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:37.760
Really?

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:41.970
Ah... Sana, so go ahead and sign it.
Sorry I have such a big mouth.

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:45.930
This girl cares a lot,
she's so great.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.390
Scene change!

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:51.560
I came here when I was in
kindergarten... I was born in Tokyo...

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:55.770
That girl is
so scary with that accent.

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:57.270
She looks mean.

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:01.700
Because this is my mom's alma mater,
I came here to study.

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:02.950
Is that so?

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:05.530
Those two ever there
keep staring at us.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:07.580
What are you two doing?!

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:12.790
You want to see what I can do?
Is the way I talk really that strange?

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:15.460
If you want to laugh,
then do it to my face me?

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:19.090
You're useless! And you call
yourselves middle school students?

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:22.050
Yeah, great! You tell them, Fuka!

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:24.430
You two, what makes you
so much better than others?

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:27.470
That eastern accent
makes you people look weird!

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:28.850
Yeah, yeah.

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.310
Do you understand what's going on?

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.480
You're nothing like gentlemen.

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:35.020
Pointing and laughing at people
behind their back is so rude!

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:38.190
Do you understand? You wussies!

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.980
Sana, I didn't say it so harshly.

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.820
Oh, you suddenly changed the topic?

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:44.740
Don't try to talk like me!

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.160
I get it.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.950
I don't know why I'm getting angry.

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:49.330
Please be a little more calm.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.290
Before exiting the stage,
take a bow.

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:54.330
But don't
laugh behind people's backs!

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:55.330
Sorry.

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:59.000
Is it over yet?
Can the teacher introduce himself?

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.750
It's the homeroom teacher.

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:05.010
Deja-vu

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:02.800
It's like me from before.

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:05.010
This is my spot!

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:07.300
Okay, we can skip over this.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:10.310
Do you know which clubs you want to
join. Do you want to check them out?

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:12.980
I want to participate
in the cooking club.

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:14.390
It doesn't suit you.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:18.980
How can it be? I have be on a cooking show. They called me Little Diner Sana!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:20.270
Liar!

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:24.610
Oh yeah, I wonder what Hayama's
doing. I wonder if he'll do karate.

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:27.030
Hayama, huh? Your boyfriend?

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:31.080
No, no, no, only a friend and mortal
enemy! I'm gonna introduce you to him.

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.450
Fighting! They're fighting!

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:35.370
- Looks like fun!
- Let's go look!

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:37.420
- It can't be...
- It's a fight!

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:41.170
Oh! Sana-chan! Akito-kun is
in trouble! Come stop them quick!

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:43.010
I thought so. Hayama.

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:45.010
Is he Sana's boyfriend? Sana-chan!

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:47.430
No, no, no, my mortal enemy.

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:50.220
Then I don't want to meet him now.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:53.390
I'll see for myself.
Next time you can introduce me.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:54.890
Sorry.

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:57.020
Hmm... Hayama?

00:13:58.270 --> 00:13:59.650
That moron...

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:04.940
...the first day of school
and he's already fighting?!

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:15.910
{part b}

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:10.370
What is the importance of the first day?

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:15.120
School entrance ceremony!

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.540
Out of my way!

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:23.090
I'm coming! I'm coming! I'm coming!

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:27.720
Sana-chan, hurry and stop them.
Think of something. There's nothing I can do!

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:30.590
I don't know what to
do in these situations!

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:32.220
Am I a coward? I think I am.

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:35.680
Tsuyoshi-kun, don't talk.
Aya-chan, what's going on?

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:38.230
I think the mysterious kid started it.

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:39.480
Mysterious kid?

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:41.110
He isn't afraid to fight Hayama?

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:43.150
He must come from another elementary school.

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:44.570
Looks like it.

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:46.610
I think Hayama's getting stronger.

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:50.780
I think it must be because of
what he learned in karate.

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:53.870
That's right. It looks like
he just came out of karate.

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:58.250
I think it's because of his moves
that the opponent is angrier.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.870
Looks like he's just playing.

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:03.040
Um... Sana-chan, please stop them.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.460
Oh yeah!

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:08.590
Hurry up and stop fighting. You
can't fight on the first day of school!

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:12.180
If you don't care about what
she says, let's skip over it. Cut.

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:13.800
What are you doing?

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:16.010
Doesn't the karate club forbid fighting?

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:17.270
He's the one that started it.

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:19.560
- Is that so?
- That's not it.

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:21.520
Hey you!

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:23.560
He hasn't quite gotten used
to Sana's attack.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:28.440
Hey bushy eyebrows and no eyelashes...

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:32.280
That's right. Bushy
eyebrows but no eyelashes.

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:34.490
Isn't he that suspicious guy?

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:37.040
Hey, screen's fuzzy and
dreamy all of a sudden...

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:40.120
So that's how he feels
when he looks at her.

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.670
It has nothing to do with you!

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:44.840
How can you come here in
front of Babbit? How scary!

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:47.130
Sana-chan is so close to me.

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:51.050
What's wrong with you?!

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:53.140
- His nose is bleeding so much!
- His eyebrows are so thick!

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:56.220
- His eyebrows are so thick!
- His nose is bleeding so much!

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:59.680
Akito-kun also agrees. This isn't the right time to say stuff like this.

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:01.140
Take him to the nurse's station.

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:05.270
This week's thick-eye browed,
nosebleed kid.

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:12.320
The nurses isn't here, so
use this to stop the bleeding.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:13.570
Okay...

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:15.490
Thank you...

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.830
Cool!

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:22.120
He seemed to be Sana-chan's fan,
his face was red.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:23.580
So it doesn't matter.

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:27.670
This is the first time I made
someone's nose bleed. I have mixed feelings.

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:28.710
Geez!

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:31.420
Getting a nosebleed from looking
at a girl who doesn't wear a bra?

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:35.760
Sana-chan hasn't changed.

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:37.720
Why don't you ask him the reason
they fought?

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:40.140
Why did you fight with him, eh?

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:44.100
You still haven't taken your foot away, how do you expect Hayama to answer?

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:45.350
That is the cause of a quarrel

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:45.560
Next.

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:48.230
Back then when I was going home...

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:55.070
Hey, you're Sana-chan's friend,
aren't you? I've seen you talk to her.

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:56.870
He started talking to me first.

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:02.750
I want to become friends
with Sana-chan, because I'm her fan.

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:04.670
Please introduce me to her.

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:07.420
No. Too much trouble.

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:11.170
And then out of nowhere
he started getting angry.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:14.380
I'm now in a really complicated mood.

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:18.140
It's a good thing the teacher
didn't see you guys fight.

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:21.970
What if you had gotten black listed on the first day of school?

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:24.600
Hey, why are you sleeping on the bed?

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.560
Wake me up in an hour.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:27.850
What?

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:31.690
Training is too stressful.
I have to rest, or my body won't take it.

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:34.240
Then don't train!
Who sleeps this early in the day?!

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:36.070
Ok well. I'm going back.

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.910
We can't stay here for an hour.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:40.910
Wait! How can you guys
just leave, you're mean!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.240
Shup up, I'm trying to sleep.

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:46.290
A nap at noon is a very relaxing
thing. Especially for a housewife.

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:49.880
I wish I was with
Fuka checking out the clubs.

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:52.170
You're an idiot.

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:53.960
Where do you have
the energy to annoy me?!

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:58.430
This person met you for the first time, knows you're really annoying and likes you.

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:00.100
That's really stressful.

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:02.760
Not really,
I don't think that's too stressful.

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:04.470
I'm stressed.

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:08.060
Hayama, did you make
any friends in your class?

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:09.310
Not really.

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:11.650
Pretending you're cool again.

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:14.440
I made a good friend and she has
the same personality as me.

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:16.530
I really want to tell you her name
but I want you to guess.

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:18.530
Fuka Matsui backwards.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:20.160
Don't annoy me.

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:22.780
Fuka Matsui backwards.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:24.490
Did you hear it?
Her name is Matsui Fuka.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:25.660
Everyone calls her Fuka.

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:26.750
I'm glad for you.

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.000
Nothing's changed,
still loves to sing.

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:34.920
Fuka... Fuka... The wind flower...

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:41.010
Came in the washroom... and
she became my bathroom friend...

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:46.520
She speaks with a western accent...

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:52.770
...and her face is just like mine.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.940
In other words, looks really cute!

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:58.610
Ahh! Sleeping?

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.410
The song she just sang sounded
a lot like a lullaby...

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:05.450
This kid sleeps really deeply.

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:17.510
From today we're middle school
students. But nothing's changed.

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:23.390
Oh yeah, I remember when he
choked me...

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:27.560
...and he told me he wanted me
to die.

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:33.690
Will something change between us?

00:19:57.380 --> 00:20:01.630
It's not love, it's not hate.

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:05.430
So in the end, what are you to me?

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:14.230
Now that we're middle school
students, what will change between us?

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:24.070
What's your name again?

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:25.320
S-Sasaki.

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:28.490
Ahh! Sasaki! You're Sana's friend?

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:30.910
So back then you're the one
who was yelling for help!

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:33.540
- Where is Sana?
- In the Nurse's office.

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.420
Ahh really? Thanks.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:39.840
Oh yeah, forgot to tell you my
name. My name is Matsui Fuka...

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:42.470
- Nice to meet you.
- Nice to meet you!

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:43.630
Is she your girlfriend? Cute!

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:46.050
There's no such thing!

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:47.430
No such thing?

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:50.470
- Well... what I'm trying to say is...
- Ah, who is she?

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:52.850
Her first name is Fuka
and last name is Matsui.

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:55.350
I get the feeling she and Sana look alike.

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:57.650
Fuka... hmm... Fuka...

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:00.070
Why does her name sound familiar?

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:04.110
Sana? Why don't I see anybody?

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:06.660
Sana?! Are you here?

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:12.410
Sana, were you on a date?

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:14.250
That's not it!

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:14.000
That's not it!

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:17.250
No...
I don't realize I was sleeping.

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:20.000
First day of school,
what's happening to me?

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.800
Who is that? Your boyfriend?

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:24.220
No, no, no... for the third time.

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:26.470
He's the guy that I told you about...
Hayama.

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:28.180
He's my enemy too.

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:30.810
- Good nap.
- Hayama.

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:34.430
Meet my friend...

00:21:34.430 --> 00:21:35.940
Matsui Fuka-chan.

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:38.310
Here's Hayama!

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:39.980
How do you do?

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:41.650
What's wrong with this woman?

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:47.700
You...
Does your name have 'Aki' in it?

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:51.910
No, no,
you can call him Peggy or Aa-chan.

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:54.120
I think you're the only one
who calls him that.

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:57.170
But you can call him Akito.
It's ok too. Aki.

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:02.000
What does she want to do anyway?

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:01.590
Really... You're Hayama Akito?!

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:03.630
Yeah, that's right.

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:14.140
Because of you...

00:22:15.680 --> 00:22:19.520
Because of you my life
became really screwed up!

